 ## [Unreleased]

+### Added
+
+- Three `opencode-go` backends (one per protocol) reach OpenCode Go's subscription.
+- OpenCode Go requests carry the required `x-opencode-session` header per conversation.
+- `meka account usage` reports an OpenCode Go subscription's dollar-budget windows.
+
 ### Security

 - RUSTSEC-2026-0285: `rustls` 0.23.45 closes a TLS 1.3 handshake flaw in the version shipped before.
